---
<section class="about" id="about" data-animate="section">
  <div class="about__inner">
    <h2>Art is for everyone</h2>
    <p class="about__body">
      Great art shouldn't require a degree. The stories behind it shouldn't sit behind museum labels or audio-guide rentals. Whether you're in the Louvre or noticing a mural on the way home, every painting has a story. We wrote it for you.
    </p>
    <div class="about__divider" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <p class="about__closing">
      Built so the next time you visit a museum, you walk out with more than tired feet.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about {
    background: #FAFAF7;
    padding: var(--space-30) var(--space-6);
  }

  .about__inner {
    max-width: var(--container-narrow);
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 32px;
  }

  h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: var(--text-section-h);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: var(--leading-snug);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .about__body {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: var(--text-body-lg);
    line-height: var(--leading-loose);
    color: var(--color-text-warm-dark);
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .about__divider {
    width: 56px;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--color-divider);
    margin: 24px 0;
  }

  .about__closing {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: var(--leading-normal);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    max-width: 560px;
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .about__body {
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .about__divider {
      width: 32px;
      margin: 16px 0;
    }
    .about__closing {
      font-size: 14px;
    }
  }
</style>
